-- חוזר לבעלויות תשס"ח/7 — הפסקת תשלום תוספת השעה הפרטנית 4.5% (16.7.2008)
-- The Treasury's instruction to stop the 4.5% individual-hour supplement
-- from July 2008's salary, no reform having been agreed with the secondary
-- teachers' organisation; nothing of it is paid for July–August.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `הפסקת תשלום תוספת השעה הפרטנית 4.5%`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (16.7.2008), subject line, and the recital that these are the Treasury's instructions following the letter of 1.7.2008 of the deputy wage commissioner; no rule.

-- Time in this file is counted in salary months of 2008: July is 7.
`July 2008`   MEANS 7
`August 2008` MEANS 8

`the individual-hour supplement rate` MEANS 4.5%

DECLARE `supplement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the individual-hour supplement` HAS `share paid` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of the 4.5% supplement paid, 1 = all of it

-- §1: under the collective agreement of 24.1.2008 (circular תשס"ח/4), no
-- reform having been agreed with the teachers' organisation, the 4.5%
-- supplement stops from July's salary for teaching employees of the owning
-- bodies. Whether a reform was agreed is the fact the stop rests on; the
-- circular states it, and it is an input here.
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN month IS A NUMBER, `a reform was agreed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the individual-hour supplement is payable in` month `a reform was agreed` IF
    month LESS THAN `July 2008` OR `a reform was agreed`

-- §2: in July–August nothing of the component is paid, not even part of
-- the supplement that was paid before.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `no part of the supplement in July–August` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `pay the individual-hour supplement` s
          PROVIDED s GREATER THAN 0
    WITHIN `August 2008` MINUS `July 2008` PLUS 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 2: no part of the individual-hour supplement is paid in July–August 2008"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

#ASSERT `the individual-hour supplement is payable in` 6 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the individual-hour supplement is payable in` `July 2008` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the individual-hour supplement is payable in` `August 2008` FALSE

-- Time from July 2008 (0): paying half the supplement in August breaches §2;
-- paying nothing through August respects it.
#TRACE `no part of the supplement in July–August` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the individual-hour supplement` 0.5 AT 1
#TRACE `no part of the supplement in July–August` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the individual-hour supplement` 0 AT 1
